"legal.actualizado":"Last updated: October 2026.",
"legal.aviso_1":"This site (Aion 2 Forge) is an AION 2 fan project. It is not an official NCSOFT service or partner.",
"legal.aviso_2":"AION, AION 2, class names, characters, logos and game images are trademarks or content of NCSOFT / NC Company. Use here is informational for a fan community.",
"legal.aviso_3":"Character, ranking and gear data shown via Spy / Tops come from the public game API (global regions EU/NA/LA/AS) and may be incomplete or outdated. Accuracy is not guaranteed.",
"legal.aviso_4":"The site is provided “as is”, with no guarantee of continuous availability. Builds, guides and tools are indicative; use them at your own risk in-game.",
"legal.aviso_5":"User-published content (builds, forum, chat) is the responsibility of the poster. The site team may moderate, hide or remove abusive, illegal or non-compliant material.",
"legal.aviso_6":"Using the site for scams, RMT, phishing, harassment or any illegal activity is forbidden. Breaches may lead to suspension or account deletion.",
"legal.aviso_7":"Community contact: the Discord linked in the site footer (when configured). There is no commercial support or official NC support.",
"legal.aviso_h":"Legal notice",
"legal.aviso_n":"7",
"legal.cookies_1":"We use cookies and technical storage strictly necessary for the site to work. We do not use advertising cookies or third-party analytics for marketing.",
"legal.cookies_2":"Session cookie: securely identifies your login (HTTP-only). Without it you cannot stay signed in. It expires per server settings (about 30 days for a permanent session).",
"legal.cookies_3":"Language preference: stored in the browser (localStorage) to remember ES/EN. You can clear it by wiping site data.",
"legal.cookies_4":"Cloudflare Turnstile (only on registration, when enabled) may set Cloudflare’s own technical cookies to tell humans from bots.",
"legal.cookies_5":"As these are necessary for the service you request (sign-in / security), we do not show a marketing consent wall. See the privacy policy for more detail.",
"legal.cookies_h":"Cookies",
"legal.cookies_n":"5",
"legal.intro":"Basic texts for a non-profit fan site. They are not a substitute for professional legal advice.",
"legal.nav_aviso":"Legal notice",
"legal.nav_cookies":"Cookies",
"legal.nav_privacidad":"Privacy",
"legal.privacidad_1":"Data controller: the Aion 2 Forge fan community operating this non-commercial site. Contact: Discord (footer link).",
"legal.privacidad_10":"If you believe processing is unlawful, you may complain to your national data protection authority (in Spain, the AEPD). This site is not aimed at children under 14; do not register if you are below the legal minimum age in your country.",
"legal.privacidad_2":"We do not ask for email or civil identity data. On sign-up we only store: username, password hash (never plain password), role and sign-up date.",
"legal.privacidad_3":"If you use the site signed in we may also store: builds, linked characters (public game IDs), forum/chat messages, build votes, moderation reports and internal notifications.",
"legal.privacidad_4":"Purpose: run the community (builds, Spy, forum, chat, tops), security (anti-bot, abuse limits) and moderation. Legal basis: performing the service you request by creating an account and, where needed, legitimate interest in community security.",
"legal.privacidad_5":"Technical data: session cookie (required to sign in), IP for temporary anti-abuse limits, and aggregated visit counters with an anonymous fingerprint (not tied to your account).",
"legal.privacidad_6":"Registration may use Cloudflare Turnstile (anti-bot). Cloudflare processes the token under its own policy. We do not use ads or third-party tracking networks on the site.",
"legal.privacidad_7":"Processors / hosting: API and database run on cloud providers (e.g. Render and Neon). The static mirror may be served from GitHub Pages. International transfers may occur; common industry providers are used.",
"legal.privacidad_8":"Retention: while you keep the account. If you delete it, we remove username, builds, linked characters, votes and notifications. Forum posts are anonymized (“Deleted account”). Your chat is deleted. Non-personal visit aggregates may remain.",
"legal.privacidad_9":"Your rights (GDPR): access, rectification, erasure, restriction and objection. You can change your password and delete the account under My builds → Account & security. You may also ask via Discord (footer).",
"legal.privacidad_h":"Privacy policy",
"legal.privacidad_n":"10",
"legal.titulo":"Legal information",
"legal.ver_privacidad":"View privacy policy",
